---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout currentPage="terms" title="Terms of Service - Yahao Translate">
  <Header currentPage="terms" />
  <main>
    <article class="terms-page">
      <div class="terms-container">
        <header class="terms-header">
          <h1 class="terms-title">Yahao Translate Terms of Service</h1>
          <p class="terms-date">Last Updated: October 16, 2026</p>
        </header>
        
        <div class="terms-content">
          <p>Welcome to Yahao Translate (hereinafter referred to as "this service"). This agreement is a legal agreement between you ("user") and us. Please read it carefully before using this service.</p>
          
          <p>By using or continuing to use this service, you indicate that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by the following terms. If you do not agree to these terms, please stop using this service.</p>
          
          <h2>1. Service Content</h2>
          <p>Yahao Translate is an AI-powered browser extension built for Shopify's Translate &amp; Adapt app. It supports individual-field and one-click batch translation, translation usage tracking, accounts and subscriptions. Advanced models and saved glossary terms are available with Pro.</p>
          <p>You need a compatible browser and access to the Shopify content you want to translate. Yahao Translate is an independent service and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Shopify, Google or Microsoft.</p>
          <p>We may update features as the service develops. Feature availability and usage limits depend on your plan.</p>

          <h2>2. Accounts and Guest Access</h2>
          <p>You may use supported features as a guest or sign in to an account. Guest access uses a device identifier and IP-derived security signals to enforce limits and prevent abuse. Account access allows us to manage your plan, translation usage and saved glossary terms.</p>
          <p>You must provide accurate account information, keep your login credentials secure and only access accounts and Shopify stores you are authorized to use. Contact us if you suspect unauthorized account access.</p>

          <h2>3. License and Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p>We grant you a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to use the extension for lawful personal or business purposes, including translating content for Shopify stores you own or are authorized to manage. Normal batch translation through the extension is permitted within your plan's usage limits.</p>
          <p>You must have the rights and permissions needed to submit content for translation. You may not:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Bypass authentication, payment requirements, usage limits or security controls</li>
            <li>Use multiple accounts or device identifiers to evade limits</li>
            <li>Attack the service, interfere with other users or make abusive or unauthorized automated requests</li>
            <li>Resell access to the extension or service without our permission</li>
            <li>Submit unlawful content or content that infringes another person's rights</li>
            <li>Attempt to crack, decompile or reverse engineer the extension or service, except where applicable law permits it</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We may suspend or terminate access for violations of these terms.</p>

          <h2>4. Plans, Subscriptions and Payments</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Free:</strong> 150 translations / chats per month, Fast mode, and no advanced models or custom glossary.</li>
            <li><strong>Pro:</strong> 10,000 translations / chats per month, Balanced and Accurate models, a custom glossary with up to 500 terms, and priority email support.</li>
            <li><strong>Enterprise:</strong> Higher usage limits under a separately agreed plan. Contact us for details.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>All plans support unlimited Shopify stores. Pro is currently offered at US$79 per year or US$12.50 per month. The billing period, total payable amount and any applicable taxes are shown at checkout.</p>
          <p>Pro checkout and subscription payments are handled by Lemon Squeezy. Recurring subscriptions renew for the selected billing period until cancelled. You can manage or cancel your subscription through the Lemon Squeezy billing link provided with your purchase, or contact us for help. Cancellation stops future renewals; access continues until the end of the paid billing period.</p>
          <p>Refund requests are handled under our <a href="/refund">Refund Policy</a> and applicable law. Cancelling a subscription or deleting an account does not itself create a refund entitlement. Contact us for help cancelling paid subscriptions before requesting account deletion.</p>
          <p>We may change prices or plan features and will notify existing subscribers in advance of changes affecting their subscriptions.</p>

          <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>Supabase provides authentication, data storage and our service infrastructure. Text submitted for translation is sent to our service on Supabase and forwarded to Alibaba Cloud's AI models. The resulting translation is returned to the extension for use in Shopify.</p>
          <p>Lemon Squeezy handles payments. Google may process information when you choose Google sign-in. Your use of these providers' services may also be subject to their applicable terms.</p>
          <p>We use these services to provide and protect the extension, not for advertising or selling your data. Data handling is described in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. Information received from Google APIs is handled in accordance with the Chrome Web Store User Data Policy, including its Limited Use requirements.</p>

          <h2>6. Service Changes and Interruptions</h2>
          <p>We may suspend or interrupt this service due to the following situations:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>System maintenance or upgrades</li>
            <li>Third-party model service failures</li>
            <li>Force majeure (power outages, network fluctuations, policy changes, etc.)</li>
            <li>User violations and service abuse</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We will try to notify in advance but do not guarantee service availability at all times.</p>
          
          <h2>7. Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>You understand and agree that:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Translation results are generated by AI and may not be completely accurate</li>
            <li>We are not responsible for any losses caused by translation errors</li>
            <li>This service is provided "as is" and "as available," without guarantee of error-free or uninterrupted operation</li>
          </ul>
          
          <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Our liability is limited to the subscription fees you have paid in the last 3 months</li>
            <li>We are not responsible for indirect, incidental, business loss, profit loss, or data loss</li>
          </ul>
          
          <h2>9. User Data and Privacy</h2>
          <p>Account, authentication, guest security signals, usage records, glossary terms and subscription information are handled as described in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>. Operational usage records do not include submitted translation text.</p>
          <p>You can manage or delete saved glossary terms in the extension. For access to or deletion of your data, contact us through <a href="/contact">our contact page</a>.</p>

          <h2>10. Service Termination</h2>
          <p>We may suspend or terminate your account in the following situations:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Serious abuse of API or translation resources</li>
            <li>Violation of laws, policies, or this agreement</li>
            <li>Long-term non-use of account (if applicable)</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Users may also request account closure at any time.</p>
          
          <h2>11. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These terms are governed by the applicable laws of the user's location.</p>
          
          <h2>12. Updates and Contact</h2>
          <p>We may update these terms as the service changes. The current version and its update date will be available on this page.</p>
          <p>For questions about these terms, subscriptions or your account, contact us through <a href="/contact">our contact page</a>.</p>


        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms-page {
    padding: 60px 0 var(--section-spacing);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
  
  .terms-container {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  
  .terms-header {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  
  .terms-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  
  .terms-date {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }
  
  .terms-content {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
  }
  
  .terms-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 40px 0 16px;
  }
  
  .terms-content h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 24px 0 12px;
  }
  
  .terms-content p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  
  .terms-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }
  
  .terms-content li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  
  .terms-content a {
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  
  .terms-content a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .terms-page {
      padding: 40px 0 var(--section-spacing);
    }
    
    .terms-container {
      padding: 0 16px;
    }
    
    .terms-header {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    
    .terms-content {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    
    .terms-content h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin: 32px 0 12px;
    }
    
    .terms-content h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
